  "title": "Nutriband Inc. Announces 2026 Annual Shareholders Meeting",
  "summary": "ORLANDO, Fla. — Nutriband Inc. (NASDAQ: NTRB, NTRBW) announced that its 2026 Annual Shareholders Meeting will be held on Saturday, January 24, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. local time, at 400 West Church Street, City National Hourglass Room, Orlando, Florida.The Company has filed and distributed its definitive proxy materials in connection with the Annual Meeting. Shareholders of record as of December 22, 2025 will be entitled to receive notice of the meeting and to vote on matters properly brought before",
